+
+生成器源码位置（同为证据，直接读 bundle 可核对）：
+- `JavaScriptLocatorFactory`（`case "role"` → `, { ${attrs.join(", ")} }`）、`chainLocators: join(".")`；
+- `PythonLocatorFactory`（`get_by_role(${quote(body)}${attrString})`，`attrString = ", " + attrs.join(", ")`，`quote` → **双引号**）；
+- `JavaLocatorFactory`（`getByRole(AriaRole.${toSnakeCase(body).toUpperCase()}${attrString})`，`attrString = ", new ${clazz}.GetByRoleOptions()" + attrs.join("")`，`clazz ∈ {Page, Locator, FrameLocator}`）；
+- 动作后缀：`JavaScriptLanguageGenerator` → `` `await ${subject}.${loc}.${method}(${opts});` ``；`PythonLanguageGenerator` → `${this._awaitPrefix}${subject}.${loc}.${method}(${args})`（**无分号**，`await ` 仅 async 模式）；`JavaLanguageGenerator` → `` `${subject}.${loc}.${method}(${opts});` ``。
